                            },
                            "descriptionsByKey": {
                                "long-services": "<ul><li>Get all DIRECTV® Protection Plan Premier benefits.</li></br><li>Plus, protect your laptops and tablets against accidental damage from handling, such as drops, spills, and cracked screens.</li></ul></br><p>The initial term is 6 months, and then continues on a month- to-month basis. You can cancel at anytime, including within the initial 6 months, with no Early Termination Fee.</p></br><p>$50 deductible when you file claims on TVs, computers, laptops, tablets, home theater systems, and monitors /$2,000-per-claim limit/$6,000 annual limit.</p></br><p>Limitations and exclusions apply. See terms and conditions for complete details. <b>Receiver upgrade offer:</b> Qualified customers enrolled in a DIRECTV Protection Plan for greater than 12 consecutive months may upgrade their DIRECTV receiver every 2 years from initial date of installation or from the date of any prior receiver upgrade. Residential customers only. <b>Subject to Equipment Lease Agreement.</b>  24-month agreement required, or 12-mo. agreement required if equipment is shipped to customer without professional installation. Early Termination Fee of $10 for each month remaining on agreement, equipment non-return & additional fees apply. Must maintain a minimum base TV package of $29.99 a month.</p>",
                                "short-services": "Everything in DIRECTV Protection Plan Premier plus provides coverage from drops, spills and cracked screens for tablets and laptops."
